<details @toggle="advanced=($event.target as HTMLDetailsElement).open"><summary>高级自定义与复现设置</summary><div v-if="advanced"><NumberInput :model-value="store.seed" :min="0" :step="1" label="随机编号（用于复现）" @update:model-value="store.setSeed(Number($event))"/><button @click="store.reseed">换一个随机编号</button><NumberInput :model-value="store.limit??0" :min="0" :step="1" label="最多处理图片数（0为整个选定范围）" @update:model-value="store.setLimit(Number($event)||null)"/><p class="note">几何变换会改变图像方向和标注坐标，请按训练任务选择。</p><OpRow v-for="op in store.ops" :key="op.name" :meta="op" :state="store.state[op.name]" @toggle="store.toggleOp(op.name,$event)" @param="(key,value)=>store.setParam(op.name,key,value)"/></div></details></fieldset><p class="note">{{store.checking?'正在检查配方…':store.checkRan?(store.warnings.length?'有需要确认的注意事项':'配方已检查，可以生成副本'):'配方或范围改变后将重新检查'}}</p><p v-if="store.checkError" class="failure" role="alert">{{store.checkError}}</p></aside></template>
